| `debian-family` | apt, which every Debian-family build layer reaches for |  |  |  |
| `core/menu` | Collects the justfile fragments the rest of the image contributes |  |  |  |
| `core/shared` | A component both the Debian and Ubuntu images enable |  |  |  |
